    "name": "RadiolgyWorkFlow Full Flow",
    "description": "Full Postman collection for the RadiolgyWorkFlow service on port 8090.\n\nRecommended order:\n1. Service Control/Status\n2. Service Control/Start Missing\n3. DICOM/Parse DICOM\n4. Direct Flow/Run Pipeline Direct\n5. Direct Flow/Save Draft From Direct Run\n\nAsync UI-style flow:\n1. Jobs/Create Job\n2. Jobs/Job Events (SSE) or Jobs/Job Status\n3. Jobs/Save Draft From Captured Result\n\nCollection variables:\n- baseUrl: workflow server base URL\n- job_id: set automatically after Create Job\n- last_result_json: set automatically after direct run\n- parse_dicom_*: populated after Parse DICOM",
